  immutable_truth: Registration 1fbc78e/tree 543abd5 was gated and four-way exact. One request and one owner invocation produced one source launch, exit 1, safe code source-trace-model-load, and zero later launches. Independent read-only audit closed nine private files/13,071 bytes. No output root or numerical verdict exists.
